    984
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "शूरः स्तब्धो विकलनयनो निर्घृणोऽर्क तनुस्थे",
   "bbox": [
    376,
    1024,
    1014,
    1098
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "मेषे सस्वस्तिमिरनयन: सिंहसंस्थे निशान्ध:।",
   "bbox": [
    450,
    1086,
    1085,
    1163
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "नीचेऽन्धोऽस्व: शशिगृहगते बुद्बुदाक्ष: पतङ्गे",
   "bbox": [
    374,
    1153,
    1011,
    1230
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "भूरिद्रव्योनृपहृतधनो वक्त्ररोगी द्वितीये।। 111",
   "bbox": [
    446,
    1222,
    1084,
    1296
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If Sun is in lagna one is valiant, given to procrastination",
   "bbox": [
    367,
    1317,
    1520,
    1396
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "with trouble in eyes and pitiless. This is a general result for the",
   "bbox": [
    287,
    1366,
    1518,
    1451
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Sun in lagna. If Sun is in Aries in lagna one is wealthy but",
   "bbox": [
    286,
    1418,
    1518,
    1504
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "with eye trouble. If Sun occupies Leo in lagna one is night",
   "bbox": [
    283,
    1470,
    1516,
    1558
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "blind, if it occupies Libra there one is blind as well as poor.",
   "bbox": [
    282,
    1524,
    1510,
    1609
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "If it occupies Cancer in lagna one has defect in eyes. If",
   "bbox": [
    280,
    1577,
    1514,
    1662
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Sun occupies the 2nd house, one is rich, but loses wealth as a",
   "bbox": [
    278,
    1630,
    1510,
    1714
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "result of some action against him by govt. and has disease in",
   "bbox": [
    274,
    1683,
    1506,
    1768
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "the face.",
   "bbox": [
    278,
    1740,
    454,
    1776
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "मतिविक्रमवांस्तृतेयगेऽर्के विसुख: पीडितमानसश्चतुर्थे।",
   "bbox": [
    346,
    1814,
    1109,
    1891
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "असुतो धनवर्जितस्त्रिकोणे बलवाञ्छत्रुजितश्च शत्रुयाते।। 2।।",
   "bbox": [
    345,
    1876,
    1208,
    1960
   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Sun in the 3rd house makes one valiant, in 4th comfortless",
   "bbox": [
    344,
    1974,
    1497,
    2055
   ]
  },
  {
